      {
         "id": "SECTION_introduction",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "<p><h3>Why this game?</h3>For a very long time, people have counted by making marks. Bones with marks found by researchers show that this practice is older than cities and writing (<htcite0> ; <htcite1>). This printable game turns that idea into a physical activity: a large bone, twenty loose marks and two decks of cards.</p><p class=\"desc\"><img id=\"imgBoardBoneFigure\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('imgBoardBoneFigure', '0%')\" onkeydown=\"if(event.key==='Enter'||event.key===' '){event.preventDefault();htImageZoom('imgBoardBoneFigure', '0%');}\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Zoom image: Representation of a baboon bone with markings\" class=\"imgcenter\" /><b>Figure 1</b>: Representation of a baboon bone with markings. Image by Enrique Silván Pobes, from the work of Francisco A. González Redondo et al.<br />The original is available on ResearchGate, included here with the authorization of Doctor Francisco A. González Redondo.</p><p>This print-and-play version was inspired by the online lesson <b>Counting with the bone</b> (<htcite2>).</p>",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "adaed4fb-9c50-4ef9-ab79-c65f3c0629b8",
                     "text": "González Redondo, Francisco A., et al.",
                     "page": "",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2010",
                        "month": "02",
                        "day": "01"
                     }
                  },
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "a4f22e25-5839-407f-a1aa-634521d52b42",
                     "text": "González Redondo, Francisco A., et al.",
                     "page": "pp. 174 - 177, 180 - 182",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2010",
                        "month": "06",
                        "day": "12"
                     }
                  },
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "7d2fd4de-5c10-4811-957c-8233bc8d21de",
                     "text": "History Tracers Team",
                     "page": "Counting with the bone",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2023",
                        "month": "",
                        "day": ""
                     }
                  }
               ],
