      },
      {
         "id": "SECTION_materials",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "<p><h3>What you need</h3><ul><li>A4 paper and a printer.</li><li>Scissors.</li><li>Optional: a pencil and a glue stick or tape.</li></ul><p>Print the three sheets that follow on A4 paper in landscape orientation. Keep the bone sheet whole. Cut only the marks and the cards along the dashed borders.</p></p>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ]
      },
      {
         "id": "SECTION_bone",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "<div class=\"htBoardSheet htBoardBoneSheet\"><div class=\"htBoardSheetTitle\">The bone</div><p class=\"htBoardSheetIntro\">This sheet represents the large bone. It is drawn to fill the whole A4 landscape page. The twenty dashed rectangles show where the marks can be placed, in two rows of ten.</p><svg class=\"htBoardBoneSvg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 520\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Large bone with twenty rectangular positions in two rows for placing marks\"><path class=\"htBoardBoneShape\" d=\"M 100 260 C 65 220 70 170 110 180 C 125 135 185 145 195 195 L 605 195 C 615 145 675 135 690 180 C 730 170 735 220 700 260 C 735 300 730 350 690 340 C 675 385 615 395 605 345 L 195 345 C 185 395 125 405 110 360 C 70 370 65 320 100 260 Z\"/><g class=\"htBoardBoneSlots\"><rect x=\"150.0\" y=\"200\" width=\"46.6\" height=\"67.7\"/><rect x=\"205.6\" y=\"200\" width=\"46.6\" height=\"67.7\"/><rect x=\"261.1\" y=\"200\" width=\"46.6\" height=\"67.7\"/><rect x=\"316.7\" y=\"200\" width=\"46.6\" height=\"67.7\"/><rect x=\"372.2\" y=\"200\" width=\"46.6\" height=\"67.7\"/><rect x=\"427.8\" y=\"200\" width=\"46.6\" height=\"67.7\"/><rect x=\"483.3\" y=\"200\" width=\"46.6\" height=\"67.7\"/><rect x=\"538.9\" y=\"200\" width=\"46.6\" height=\"67.7\"/><rect x=\"594.4\" y=\"200\" width=\"46.6\" height=\"67.7\"/><rect x=\"650.0\" y=\"200\" width=\"46.6\" height=\"67.7\"/><rect x=\"150.0\" y=\"275\" width=\"46.6\" height=\"67.7\"/><rect x=\"205.6\" y=\"275\" width=\"46.6\" height=\"67.7\"/><rect x=\"261.1\" y=\"275\" width=\"46.6\" height=\"67.7\"/><rect x=\"316.7\" y=\"275\" width=\"46.6\" height=\"67.7\"/><rect x=\"372.2\" y=\"275\" width=\"46.6\" height=\"67.7\"/><rect x=\"427.8\" y=\"275\" width=\"46.6\" height=\"67.7\"/><rect x=\"483.3\" y=\"275\" width=\"46.6\" height=\"67.7\"/><rect x=\"538.9\" y=\"275\" width=\"46.6\" height=\"67.7\"/><rect x=\"594.4\" y=\"275\" width=\"46.6\" height=\"67.7\"/><rect x=\"650.0\" y=\"275\" width=\"46.6\" height=\"67.7\"/></g></svg><p class=\"htBoardSheetNote\">Place the cut-out rectangle marks from left to right, first on the upper row and then on the lower row.</p></div>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ]
      },
      {
         "id": "SECTION_marks",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "<div class=\"htBoardSheet htBoardMarksSheet\"><div class=\"htBoardSheetTitle\">Twenty rectangular marks to cut</div><p class=\"htBoardSheetIntro\">Cut out the twenty rectangular marks along the dashed borders. Each mark fits one dashed rectangle on the bone.</p><div class=\"htBoardMarkGrid\" aria-label=\"Twenty rectangular marks to cut\"><div class=\"htBoardMarkToken\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"htBoardMarkGlyph\"></span></div><div class=\"htBoardMarkToken\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"htBoardMarkGlyph\"></span></div><div class=\"htBoardMarkToken\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"htBoardMarkGlyph\"></span></div><div class=\"htBoardMarkToken\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"htBoardMarkGlyph\"></span></div><div class=\"htBoardMarkToken\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"htBoardMarkGlyph\"></span></div><div class=\"htBoardMarkToken\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"htBoardMarkGlyph\"></span></div><div class=\"htBoardMarkToken\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"htBoardMarkGlyph\"></span></div><div class=\"htBoardMarkToken\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"htBoardMarkGlyph\"></span></div><div class=\"htBoardMarkToken\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"htBoardMarkGlyph\"></span></div><div class=\"htBoardMarkToken\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"htBoardMarkGlyph\"></span></div><div class=\"htBoardMarkToken\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"htBoardMarkGlyph\"></span></div><div class=\"htBoardMarkToken\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"htBoardMarkGlyph\"></span></div><div class=\"htBoardMarkToken\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"htBoardMarkGlyph\"></span></div><div class=\"htBoardMarkToken\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"htBoardMarkGlyph\"></span></div><div class=\"htBoardMarkToken\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"htBoardMarkGlyph\"></span></div><div class=\"htBoardMarkToken\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"htBoardMarkGlyph\"></span></div><div class=\"htBoardMarkToken\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"htBoardMarkGlyph\"></span></div><div class=\"htBoardMarkToken\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"htBoardMarkGlyph\"></span></div><div class=\"htBoardMarkToken\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"htBoardMarkGlyph\"></span></div><div class=\"htBoardMarkToken\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"htBoardMarkGlyph\"></span></div></div><p class=\"htBoardSheetNote\">Cut along the dashed lines.</p></div>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ]
      },
      {
         "id": "SECTION_cards",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "<div class=\"htBoardSheet htBoardCardsSheet\"><div class=\"htBoardSheetTitle\">Addition cards to cut</div><p class=\"htBoardSheetIntro\">Cut out the two decks along the dashed borders. Keep deck A and deck B separate, then turn each deck face down.</p><div class=\"htBoardDeck\"><div class=\"htBoardDeckTitle\">Deck A — first number</div><div class=\"htBoardCardGrid\"><div class=\"htBoardCard\"><span class=\"htBoardCardLabel\">A</span><span class=\"htBoardCardNumber\">1</span></div><div class=\"htBoardCard\"><span class=\"htBoardCardLabel\">A</span><span class=\"htBoardCardNumber\">2</span></div><div class=\"htBoardCard\"><span class=\"htBoardCardLabel\">A</span><span class=\"htBoardCardNumber\">3</span></div><div class=\"htBoardCard\"><span class=\"htBoardCardLabel\">A</span><span class=\"htBoardCardNumber\">4</span></div><div class=\"htBoardCard\"><span class=\"htBoardCardLabel\">A</span><span class=\"htBoardCardNumber\">5</span></div><div class=\"htBoardCard\"><span class=\"htBoardCardLabel\">A</span><span class=\"htBoardCardNumber\">6</span></div><div class=\"htBoardCard\"><span class=\"htBoardCardLabel\">A</span><span class=\"htBoardCardNumber\">7</span></div><div class=\"htBoardCard\"><span class=\"htBoardCardLabel\">A</span><span class=\"htBoardCardNumber\">8</span></div><div class=\"htBoardCard\"><span class=\"htBoardCardLabel\">A</span><span class=\"htBoardCardNumber\">9</span></div><div class=\"htBoardCard\"><span class=\"htBoardCardLabel\">A</span><span class=\"htBoardCardNumber\">10</span></div></div></div><div class=\"htBoardDeck\"><div class=\"htBoardDeckTitle\">Deck B — second number</div><div class=\"htBoardCardGrid\"><div class=\"htBoardCard\"><span class=\"htBoardCardLabel\">B</span><span class=\"htBoardCardNumber\">1</span></div><div class=\"htBoardCard\"><span class=\"htBoardCardLabel\">B</span><span class=\"htBoardCardNumber\">2</span></div><div class=\"htBoardCard\"><span class=\"htBoardCardLabel\">B</span><span class=\"htBoardCardNumber\">3</span></div><div class=\"htBoardCard\"><span class=\"htBoardCardLabel\">B</span><span class=\"htBoardCardNumber\">4</span></div><div class=\"htBoardCard\"><span class=\"htBoardCardLabel\">B</span><span class=\"htBoardCardNumber\">5</span></div><div class=\"htBoardCard\"><span class=\"htBoardCardLabel\">B</span><span class=\"htBoardCardNumber\">6</span></div><div class=\"htBoardCard\"><span class=\"htBoardCardLabel\">B</span><span class=\"htBoardCardNumber\">7</span></div><div class=\"htBoardCard\"><span class=\"htBoardCardLabel\">B</span><span class=\"htBoardCardNumber\">8</span></div><div class=\"htBoardCard\"><span class=\"htBoardCardLabel\">B</span><span class=\"htBoardCardNumber\">9</span></div><div class=\"htBoardCard\"><span class=\"htBoardCardLabel\">B</span><span class=\"htBoardCardNumber\">10</span></div></div></div><p class=\"htBoardSheetNote\">Cut along the dashed lines and keep the two decks apart.</p></div>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ]
      },
      {
         "id": "SECTION_rules",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "<p><h3>How to count</h3><ol><li>Place the bone sheet in front of you and keep the twenty marks nearby.</li><li>Choose how many marks you want to count. Place them one by one on the dashed rectangles, from left to right: first the upper row, then the lower row.</li><li>Say the number aloud each time you place a mark: one, two, three...</li><li>The last number you say is the quantity you placed.</li></ol></p><p><h3>How to add</h3><ol><li>Mix each deck separately and turn both decks face down.</li><li>Draw one card from deck A and one card from deck B, then turn them face up.</li><li>Place on the bone the number of marks shown on card A, counting aloud from one.</li><li>Continue with the number of marks shown on card B without starting over: after three marks, four more marks are counted as four, five, six, seven.</li><li>The last number you say is the sum. Return all the marks to the space beside the bone, then turn the cards face down, mix the decks and play again.</li></ol></p><p><b>Example:</b> if deck A shows 3 and deck B shows 4, place three marks saying 1, 2, 3, then four more saying 4, 5, 6, 7. The sum is 7.</p>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ]
      },
      {
         "id": "SECTION_credits",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "<p><h3>Credits</h3><p>Figure 1: representation of a baboon bone with markings, by Enrique Silván Pobes, from the work of Francisco A. González Redondo et al. (<htcite0> ; <htcite1>), included with the authorization of Doctor Francisco A. González Redondo. This printable version is part of the History Tracers Board Games section and was inspired by the online lesson <b>Counting with the bone</b> (<htcite2>).</p></p>",
